1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,069
Day 6 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,711
61 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,711 --> 00:00:06,782
…and 30 of them
are from Taminee!

4
00:00:06,782 --> 00:00:09,503
Taminee takes the spam crown
from Mats!

5
00:00:09,503 --> 00:00:12,480
Still, that's
€60 for the town!

6
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,831
Yesterday: 107 residents.

7
00:00:15,831 --> 00:00:18,634
Today, we are 122!

8
00:00:18,974 --> 00:00:23,285
That brings
€15,135 into the budget!

9
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:27,391
Erik says: stop building houses,
save for the school!

10
00:00:27,391 --> 00:00:31,389
Okay! From now on, half
of all money goes into the school fund!

11
00:00:31,729 --> 00:00:33,812
Kalilay gets
a farm home!

12
00:00:34,152 --> 00:00:36,385
Camille gets
a green house!

13
00:00:36,725 --> 00:00:39,917
Iain, Minijr and Terry:
your homes come next!

14
00:00:40,257 --> 00:00:43,024
Thomas wanted
a giant "VI" behind the house…

15
00:00:43,024 --> 00:00:43,749
Done!

16
00:00:44,089 --> 00:00:46,485
Wait… neleski is
Mats' TV?!

17
00:00:46,485 --> 00:00:48,532
Then it moves in
with Mats too!

18
00:00:48,872 --> 00:00:52,847
Ayden, Amirali and 10 more
move into the apartment block!

19
00:00:53,187 --> 00:00:54,968
Leoville is hiring!

20
00:00:54,968 --> 00:00:57,329
Here are the first
jobs you asked for!

21
00:00:57,329 --> 00:01:00,364
Well-damn-lol wants to be a famous rapper…

22
00:01:00,364 --> 00:01:03,166
The shops open as soon
as we have the money!

23
00:01:03,506 --> 00:01:05,751
Ambo
wants to be president too!

24
00:01:05,751 --> 00:01:08,309
The election has
7 candidates now!

25
00:01:08,309 --> 00:01:10,554
Divish leads
with 3 votes!

26
00:01:10,554 --> 00:01:12,463
Reply with a name
to vote!

27
00:01:12,803 --> 00:01:15,308
€40k, Ayo?
Nice try!

28
00:01:15,308 --> 00:01:18,478
Only subs, likes and comments
pay into the budget!

29
00:01:18,818 --> 00:01:21,458
Taminee: first time
in a video?

30
00:01:21,458 --> 00:01:23,587
Welcome to Leoville TV!

31
00:01:23,927 --> 00:01:25,905
A tornado, Symon?!

32
00:01:25,905 --> 00:01:28,626
Leo says: not in
Leoville!

33
00:01:28,966 --> 00:01:30,646
Joke of the day
by Mats:

34
00:01:30,646 --> 00:01:32,976
"what is the difference between me and a bench?"

35
00:01:32,976 --> 00:01:35,418
…we are still waiting
for the punchline!

36
00:01:35,758 --> 00:01:38,071
Bread, you already
have a bunker!

37
00:01:38,411 --> 00:01:39,953
And what do you
want next?

38
00:01:39,953 --> 00:01:41,780
The school is in the lead!

39
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:45,420
The school costs
€120,000.

40
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:50,033
The school fund
already has €7,567!

41
00:01:50,033 --> 00:01:52,510
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

42
00:01:52,850 --> 00:01:54,457
Which job
do you want?

43
00:01:54,457 --> 00:01:56,098
Tell me in the
comments!
